              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "le candidat — \"the candidate, the applicant\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Il y a vingt candidats pour ce poste. There are twenty applicants for this job."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine candidate. Also in elections."
            }
          ]
        },
